contentText:
Karol G&#8217;s &#8220;BbY WOW&#8221; continues to hold strong at No.1, while her track &#8220;Ahi&#8221; with Drake sees a new high in the top 10.

Narrator&nbsp;

Here’s the Billboard Hot Latin Songs top 10 for the week dated October 17th! Neton Vega is back at No. 10, “Polvo Rosita” moves up to 9, “De Lejitos” is locked at 8, as is “Matadora” at 7, and Latin Mafia and Fred again.. at 6, “Koko” dips to 5, “Ayúdame” is up to 4, while “Ahí”is solid at 3 as is “DTMF” at 2 and “BbY WOW” holds on top with an eighth week at No. 1!
